QuestGuidance.Register("en",281,{
[8961]="7006C12C\n1\tComplete Mission: The Good Bacon\tYour mission is to acquire healthy boar slabs for a chef to make into his famous bacon recipe for the hungry people of Urmâkh, and cull diseased boars you encounter. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have acquired healthy boar slabs and culled diseased boars from the sounder. Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8962]="700580F6\n1\tFind the Great Goblin's treasure\tFind the Great Goblin's treasure somewhere in Goblin-town.\n2\tDefeat Hukmún\tYou have been ambushed by a goblin guarding the treasure! You should defeat Hukmún!\n",
[8963]="70058100\n1\tComplete Mission: The Great Goblin's Treasure\tYour mission is to find a great treasure somewhere in Goblin-town. Speak to Ausma to travel to Goblin-town.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8964]="70058951\n1\tDefeat the Hand of Gorgar\tYour mission is to defeat the Hand of Gorgar and reclaim Grálinvarth.\n",
[8965]="7005896C\n1\tComplete 'Mission: The Hand of Gorgar'\tYour mission is to defeat the Hand of Gorgar and reclaim Grálinvarth. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Grálinvarth.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8966]="70062FB2\n1\tDefeat White Hand Uruks in the ruins (total: 16)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8967]="70062FCC\n1\tComplete the Mission: The Hand, Out!\tReturn to the mission giver and make your way to the Uruk encampment. Head forth to strike the White Hand Uruk out of the ruins.\n2\tTalk to Hithriel\tHaving driven out a good number of the White Hand from the ruins, it is now time to speak with the mission giver and tell them of your victory.\n",
[8968]="700582E3\n1\tDefeat Rúnar Wolfstooth\tYour mission is to defeat Rúnar Wolfstooth and put an end to the Dourhand expedition into the depths of Kidzul-kâlah.\n2\tInvestigate the source of the tremor\tAfter defeating Rúnar Wolfstooth, a tremor has coursed through the depths of Kidzul-kâlah. Is this some unseen doing of the Dourhands?\n",
[8969]="700582E9\n1\tComplete 'Mission: The Heart of Kidzul-kâlah'\tYour mission is to defeat Rúnar Wolfstooth and put an end to the Dourhand expedition into the depths of Kidzul-kâlah. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Kidzul-kâlah.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8970]="7005A818\n1\tDestroy Dourhand supplies (total: 10)\030Destroy mining tools (total: 10)\030Defeat Dourhand treasure-hunters (total: 12)\tDefeat Dourhand treasure-hunters and destroy their mining supplies.\n",
[8971]="7005A821\n1\tComplete Mission: The High Dig\tYour mission is to thwart a group of Dourhand treasure hunters at High Sundergrót. Speak to Hórin to travel to High Sundergrót.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8972]="70057F13\n1\tHunt in the wilds and gather meat (total: 12)\tHunt in the wilds and gather meat.\n",
[8973]="70057F4A\n1\tComplete Mission: The Hunting Grounds\tYour mission is to hunt in the wilds and gather meat. Speak to Hórin to travel to Misthallow.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8974]="70069078\n1\tComplete Mission: The Ill-fated Cave\tYour mission is to rescue the trapped dwarf-miners (and their treasure) before the cave permanently collapses! Speak to Deshra to travel.\n2\tYou have rescued the trapped miners and successfully escaped the cave! Return to the mission giver with this report.\t\n",
[8975]="70062FBA\n1\tRescue the living\030Burn the dead (total: 6)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8976]="70063033\n1\tComplete the Mission: The Jaws of Death\tScouts believe that there may be survivors in the warg pits in the hills nearby. You are asked to go into those hills and rescue those you can, and burn the dead to stop the spread of disease.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tThe warg-matrons were present in the pit and they were fearsome. You were victorious. Return to the mission giver in Mossward and tell them of the success.\n",
[8977]="70071E03\n1\tComplete Mission: The Knife's Secret\tYour mission is to investigate Bâdrasag, the Blade-horn, for information about the Tarsâri, those who call themselves the Tasked Ones. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have explored the Blade-horn and found several texts detailing the history of the Tarsâri, though some information is missing. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[8978]="700583E9\n1\tDefeat Draupush in Ashmâr-zarakh\tYour mission is to defeat Draupush, one of the Ghâshfra in service to Gorgar the Ruthless.\n",
[8979]="70058425\n1\tComplete 'Mission: The Last Embers of Nûrz Ghâshu'\tYour mission is to defeat Draupush, one of the Ghâshfra in service to Gorgar the Ruthless. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Ashmâr-zarakh.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8980]="7005A822\n1\tFind a way into the dwarf-vault\tFind a way into the dwarf-vault.\n2\tEnter the vault\tEnter the vault.\n",
[8981]="7005A82D\n1\tComplete Mission: The Lost Vault\tYour mission is to find a way into a recently uncovered dwarf-vault in Gundabad. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8982]="700581A3\n1\tTalk to Ausma\tSpeak to Scout-master Ausma in the War Room on the upper floor Annâk-khurfu.\n2\tComplete Mission: The Main Gates\tYour mission is to scout the main gates of Gundabad with Ausma. Talk to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu to enter this mission.\n3\tTalk to Ausma\tYour mission has been completed. You should talk to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu.\n4\tTalk to Glóin\t\n",
[8983]="700581A7\n1\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have arrived close to the main gates of Gundabad. You should talk to Ausma.\n2\tFollow Ausma\tFollow Ausma as she sneaks towards the main gates of Gundabad. Watch out for Orc patrols!\n3\tDefeat the Orc patrol\tYou have been spotted by a patrolling Orc! You should defeat the patrol before they alert the others!\n4\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have successfully defeated the Orcs before they alerted the rest of the enemy forces. You should talk to Ausma.\n5\tFollow Ausma\tFollow Ausma as she sneaks towards the main gates of Gundabad. Watch out for Orc patrols!\n6\tOverhear the conversation\tAusma has stopped to overhear the Orcs talking. You should stay out of sight and listen to the Orcs.\n7\tDefeat the attackers\tYou have been sniffed out by a warg! You should defeat the attackers before they alert the others!\n8\tFollow Ausma\tYou are near the gates of Gundabad. You should follow Ausma.\n9\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have successfully scouted the main gates without alerting the Orcs. You should talk to Ausma.\n",
[8984]="7005819D\n1\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have arrived at Bekâr-zarakh, the location that Ausma believes has information on Gorgar's location. You should talk to Ausma.\n2\tFollow Ausma through the tower\tFollow Ausma through the tower. Try to pass the Orcs unseen.\n3\tOverhear the Orc conversation\tAusma has stopped, wanting to overhear the Orcs' conversation. You should listen to their conversation.\n4\tDefeat Commander Gurkug\tThe Orcs have noticed you! You should defeat Commander Gurkug.\n5\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have defeated the Orcs, but Ausma is concerned they will be missed. You should talk to Ausma.\n6\tCollect black brew (total: 6)\tAusma needs props to stage the Orc Commander's death as the result of a drunken fight. You should find and collect black brew.\n7\tTalk to Ausma\tNow that you have the black brew, you should return to Ausma.\n",
[8985]="700581A9\n1\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have been assigned another important mission! Report to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu to learn the details.\n2\tComplete Mission: The Marked Target\tYour mission is to infiltrate Bekâr-zarakh with Ausma and find Gorgar's location. Talk to Ausma to travel to Bekâr-zarakh.\n3\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! You should talk to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu.\n4\tTalk to Glóin\tThe mission is complete! You should talk to Glóin in Annâk-khurfu.\n",
[8986]="70057EAA\n1\tDefeat Askónd, Matron of the Hatchery\tFind and defeat Askónd, the Matron of the Hatchery. She can be found somewhere in the Clutch-hollow.\n",
[8987]="70057EAD\n1\tComplete Mission: The Matron of the Hatchery\tYour mission is to find and defeat Askónd, Matron of the Hatchery. Speak to Ausma to travel to the the Clutch-hollow.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8988]="70057F15\n1\tDefeat Slátra\tDefeat Slátra, who guards the High Pass.\n",
[8989]="70057F49\n1\tComplete Mission: The Matron of the High Pass\tYour mission is to defeat the vile drake matron who guards the High Pass. Speak to Ausma to travel to the High Pass.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8990]="70057F18\n1\tFind Hregvang\tFind Hregvang.\n2\tDefeat Hregvang\tDefeat Hregvang.\n",
[8991]="70057F4E\n1\tComplete Mission: The Matron of the Keep\tYour mission is to defeat the frost matron who has blockaded the entrance to the Steel Keep. Speak to Hórin to travel to the Steel Keep.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8992]="7006C504\n1\tComplete Mission: The Matron's Fang\tYour mission is to kill spiders in Ushbarab and slay the Matron of the Fang when she emerges to defend her nest. Speak with Raphûz to travel.\n2\tTalk to Raphûz\tYou have successfully defeated the Matron of the Fang in Ushbarab! Return with the scout to Raphûz with this report.\n",
